{"id":234,"slug":"234-rest-parameters-args-la-gi-khac-gi-arguments-object","category":"JavaScript","subcategory":"Functions","level":"intermediate","question_vi":"Rest parameters (...args) là gì? Khác gì arguments object?","question_en":"What are rest parameters (...args)? How do they differ from the arguments object?","answer_vi":"`...args` **gom mọi tham số còn lại thành một Array thật**.\n\n```javascript\nfunction sum(...nums) {\n  return nums.reduce((a, b) => a + b, 0)   // reduce dùng được ngay\n}\nsum(1, 2, 3)   // 6\n\nfunction log(level, ...rest) {\n  console.log(level, rest)   // rest chỉ chứa phần CHƯA được đặt tên\n}\nlog('info', 'a', 'b')   // 'info' ['a', 'b']\n```\n\nSo với `arguments`:\n\n| | `...rest` | `arguments` |\n|---|---|---|\n| Kiểu | **Array thật** | array-like, phải `Array.from()` |\n| Nội dung | chỉ phần chưa đặt tên | **toàn bộ** tham số |\n| Trong arrow function | có | **không** |\n| Đặt tên được | có | không |\n\n```javascript\nfunction old() {\n  arguments.map(x => x)          // TypeError — không phải Array\n  Array.from(arguments).map(...)  // phải chuyển trước\n}\n\nconst arrow = (...args) => args.map(x => x)   // chạy được\n```\n\nĐừng nhầm **rest** với **spread** — cùng ký hiệu `...` nhưng ngược chiều:\n\n```javascript\nconst f = (...args) => args      // rest: \"thu lại\"\nf(...[1, 2, 3])                  // spread: \"mở ra\"\n```\n\n**Lưu ý:** rest **phải là tham số cuối cùng**. `function f(a, ...rest, b) {}` là lỗi cú pháp, không phải lỗi lúc chạy","answer_en":"`...args` **collects the remaining arguments into a real Array**.\n\n```javascript\nfunction sum(...nums) {\n  return nums.reduce((a, b) => a + b, 0)   // reduce works directly\n}\nsum(1, 2, 3)   // 6\n\nfunction log(level, ...rest) {\n  console.log(level, rest)   // rest holds only the UNNAMED arguments\n}\nlog('info', 'a', 'b')   // 'info' ['a', 'b']\n```\n\nCompared with `arguments`:\n\n| | `...rest` | `arguments` |\n|---|---|---|\n| Type | **a real Array** | array-like, needs `Array.from()` |\n| Contents | only the unnamed arguments | **all** arguments |\n| In arrow functions | yes | **no** |\n| Nameable | yes | no |\n\n```javascript\nfunction old() {\n  arguments.map(x => x)          // TypeError — not an Array\n  Array.from(arguments).map(...)  // convert first\n}\n\nconst arrow = (...args) => args.map(x => x)   // works\n```\n\nDo not confuse **rest** with **spread** — same `...` token, opposite directions:\n\n```javascript\nconst f = (...args) => args      // rest: \"collect\"\nf(...[1, 2, 3])                  // spread: \"unpack\"\n```\n\n**Note:** a rest parameter **must come last**. `function f(a, ...rest, b) {}` is a syntax error, not a runtime one","answer_html_vi":"<p><code>...args</code> <strong>gom mọi tham số còn lại thành một Array thật</strong>.</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">javascript</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"function sum(...nums) {\n  return nums.reduce((a, b) =&gt; a + b, 0)   // reduce dùng được ngay\n}\nsum(1, 2, 3)   // 6\n\nfunction log(level, ...rest) {\n  console.log(level, rest)   // rest chỉ chứa phần CHƯA được đặt tên\n}\nlog('info', 'a', 'b')   // 'info' ['a', 'b']\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">function</span> <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">sum</span>(<span class=\"hljs-params\">...nums</span>) {\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">return</span> nums.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">reduce</span>(<span class=\"hljs-function\">(<span class=\"hljs-params\">a, b</span>) =&gt;</span> a + b, <span class=\"hljs-number\">0</span>)   <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// reduce dùng được ngay</span>\n}\n<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">sum</span>(<span class=\"hljs-number\">1</span>, <span class=\"hljs-number\">2</span>, <span class=\"hljs-number\">3</span>)   <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// 6</span>\n\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">function</span> <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">log</span>(<span class=\"hljs-params\">level, ...rest</span>) {\n  <span class=\"hljs-variable language_\">console</span>.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">log</span>(level, rest)   <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// rest chỉ chứa phần CHƯA được đặt tên</span>\n}\n<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">log</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;info&#x27;</span>, <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;a&#x27;</span>, <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;b&#x27;</span>)   <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// &#x27;info&#x27; [&#x27;a&#x27;, &#x27;b&#x27;]</span></code></pre></div><p class=\"qa-summary\">So với <code>arguments</code>:</p><div class=\"qa-table-wrap\"><table class=\"qa-table\"><thead><tr><th></th><th><code>...rest</code></th><th><code>arguments</code></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Kiểu</td><td><strong>Array thật</strong></td><td>array-like, phải <code>Array.from()</code></td></tr><tr><td>Nội dung</td><td>chỉ phần chưa đặt tên</td><td><strong>toàn bộ</strong> tham số</td></tr><tr><td>Trong arrow function</td><td>có</td><td><strong>không</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Đặt tên được</td><td>có</td><td>không</td></tr></tbody></table></div><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">javascript</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"function old() {\n  arguments.map(x =&gt; x)          // TypeError — không phải Array\n  Array.from(arguments).map(...)  // phải chuyển trước\n}\n\nconst arrow = (...args) =&gt; args.map(x =&gt; x)   // chạy được\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">function</span> <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">old</span>(<span class=\"hljs-params\"></span>) {\n  <span class=\"hljs-variable language_\">arguments</span>.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">map</span>(<span class=\"hljs-function\"><span class=\"hljs-params\">x</span> =&gt;</span> x)          <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// TypeError — không phải Array</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Array</span>.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">from</span>(<span class=\"hljs-variable language_\">arguments</span>).<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">map</span>(...)  <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// phải chuyển trước</span>\n}\n\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">arrow</span> = (<span class=\"hljs-params\">...args</span>) =&gt; args.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">map</span>(<span class=\"hljs-function\"><span class=\"hljs-params\">x</span> =&gt;</span> x)   <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// chạy được</span></code></pre></div><p>Đừng nhầm <strong>rest</strong> với <strong>spread</strong> — cùng ký hiệu <code>...</code> nhưng ngược chiều:</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">javascript</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"const f = (...args) =&gt; args      // rest: &quot;thu lại&quot;\nf(...[1, 2, 3])                  // spread: &quot;mở ra&quot;\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">f</span> = (<span class=\"hljs-params\">...args</span>) =&gt; args      <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// rest: &quot;thu lại&quot;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">f</span>(...[<span class=\"hljs-number\">1</span>, <span class=\"hljs-number\">2</span>, <span class=\"hljs-number\">3</span>])                  <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// spread: &quot;mở ra&quot;</span></code></pre></div><p><strong>Lưu ý:</strong> rest <strong>phải là tham số cuối cùng</strong>. <code>function f(a, ...rest, b) {}</code> là lỗi cú pháp, không phải lỗi lúc chạy.</p>","answer_html_en":"<p><code>...args</code> <strong>collects the remaining arguments into a real Array</strong>.</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">javascript</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"function sum(...nums) {\n  return nums.reduce((a, b) =&gt; a + b, 0)   // reduce works directly\n}\nsum(1, 2, 3)   // 6\n\nfunction log(level, ...rest) {\n  console.log(level, rest)   // rest holds only the UNNAMED arguments\n}\nlog('info', 'a', 'b')   // 'info' ['a', 'b']\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">function</span> <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">sum</span>(<span class=\"hljs-params\">...nums</span>) {\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">return</span> nums.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">reduce</span>(<span class=\"hljs-function\">(<span class=\"hljs-params\">a, b</span>) =&gt;</span> a + b, <span class=\"hljs-number\">0</span>)   <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// reduce works directly</span>\n}\n<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">sum</span>(<span class=\"hljs-number\">1</span>, <span class=\"hljs-number\">2</span>, <span class=\"hljs-number\">3</span>)   <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// 6</span>\n\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">function</span> <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">log</span>(<span class=\"hljs-params\">level, ...rest</span>) {\n  <span class=\"hljs-variable language_\">console</span>.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">log</span>(level, rest)   <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// rest holds only the UNNAMED arguments</span>\n}\n<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">log</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;info&#x27;</span>, <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;a&#x27;</span>, <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;b&#x27;</span>)   <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// &#x27;info&#x27; [&#x27;a&#x27;, &#x27;b&#x27;]</span></code></pre></div><p class=\"qa-summary\">Compared with <code>arguments</code>:</p><div class=\"qa-table-wrap\"><table class=\"qa-table\"><thead><tr><th></th><th><code>...rest</code></th><th><code>arguments</code></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Type</td><td><strong>a real Array</strong></td><td>array-like, needs <code>Array.from()</code></td></tr><tr><td>Contents</td><td>only the unnamed arguments</td><td><strong>all</strong> arguments</td></tr><tr><td>In arrow functions</td><td>yes</td><td><strong>no</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Nameable</td><td>yes</td><td>no</td></tr></tbody></table></div><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">javascript</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"function old() {\n  arguments.map(x =&gt; x)          // TypeError — not an Array\n  Array.from(arguments).map(...)  // convert first\n}\n\nconst arrow = (...args) =&gt; args.map(x =&gt; x)   // works\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">function</span> <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">old</span>(<span class=\"hljs-params\"></span>) {\n  <span class=\"hljs-variable language_\">arguments</span>.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">map</span>(<span class=\"hljs-function\"><span class=\"hljs-params\">x</span> =&gt;</span> x)          <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// TypeError — not an Array</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Array</span>.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">from</span>(<span class=\"hljs-variable language_\">arguments</span>).<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">map</span>(...)  <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// convert first</span>\n}\n\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">arrow</span> = (<span class=\"hljs-params\">...args</span>) =&gt; args.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">map</span>(<span class=\"hljs-function\"><span class=\"hljs-params\">x</span> =&gt;</span> x)   <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// works</span></code></pre></div><p>Do not confuse <strong>rest</strong> with <strong>spread</strong> — same <code>...</code> token, opposite directions:</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">javascript</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"const f = (...args) =&gt; args      // rest: &quot;collect&quot;\nf(...[1, 2, 3])                  // spread: &quot;unpack&quot;\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">f</span> = (<span class=\"hljs-params\">...args</span>) =&gt; args      <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// rest: &quot;collect&quot;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">f</span>(...[<span class=\"hljs-number\">1</span>, <span class=\"hljs-number\">2</span>, <span class=\"hljs-number\">3</span>])                  <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// spread: &quot;unpack&quot;</span></code></pre></div><p><strong>Note:</strong> a rest parameter <strong>must come last</strong>. <code>function f(a, ...rest, b) {}</code> is a syntax error, not a runtime one.</p>","references":[{"label":"MDN — Rest parameters","url":"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/JavaScript/Reference/Functions/rest_parameters"},{"label":"MDN — arguments object","url":"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/JavaScript/Reference/Functions/arguments"}],"related":[{"url":"/q/226-su-khac-biet-giua-function-declaration-function-expression-va-arrow-function-la","title":"Sự khác biệt giữa function declaration, function expression và arrow function là gì?"},{"url":"/q/227-callback-function-la-gi-tai-sao-javascript-dung-callbacks","title":"Callback function là gì? Tại sao JavaScript dùng callbacks?"},{"url":"/q/228-higher-order-function-la-gi-cho-vi-du","title":"Higher-order function là gì? Cho ví dụ."},{"url":"/q/229-iife-immediately-invoked-function-expression-la-gi-va-dung-de-lam-gi","title":"IIFE (Immediately Invoked Function Expression) là gì và dùng để làm gì?"},{"url":"/q/230-pure-function-la-gi-tai-sao-pure-functions-quan-trong","title":"Pure function là gì? Tại sao pure functions quan trọng?"},{"url":"/q/231-currying-la-gi-cho-vi-du-va-truong-hop-dung-thuc-te","title":"Currying là gì? Cho ví dụ và trường hợp dùng thực tế."},{"url":"/q/232-memoization-la-gi-cai-dat-memoization-don-gian-nhu-the-nao","title":"Memoization là gì? Cài đặt memoization đơn giản như thế nào?"},{"url":"/q/235-function-composition-la-gi","title":"Function composition là gì?"}]}